Development","Feb 2025 - Jul 2025","An educational life-simulation game raising awareness about insomnia among university students.",[19,20,21,22],"Unreal Engine 5","Blueprints","Game Design","Research",[24,25],"/projects/insomniacs-1.png","/projects/insomniacs-2.png","https://www.canva.com/design/DAGrjvX6J3U/fp5AZEktYFKJN7nOsCc6XA/edit","## Overview\n\nDesigned and developed solo in Unreal Engine 5 using Blueprints, with a focus on learning objectives, simulation systems, and user testing.\n\n## Contributions\n\n- Analysed and designed the learning objectives and game mechanics.\n- Implemented the core systems and UI from start to finish.\n- Integrated assets and audio, then performed functional testing.\n- Conducted pre/post user testing and coordinated expert validation.\n\n## Outcome\n\nThe prototype demonstrated measurable improvement in student understanding of insomnia through user testing and expert evaluation.","src/content/projects/insomniacs.md","447c9873079440b0",{"html":31,"metadata":32},"\u003Ch2 id=\"overview\">Overview\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Designed and developed solo in Unreal Engine 5 using Blueprints, with a focus on learning objectives, simulation systems, and user testing.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"contributions\">Contributions\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Analysed and designed the learning objectives and game mechanics.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Implemented the core systems and UI from start to finish.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Integrated assets and audio, then performed functional testing.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Conducted pre/post user testing and coordinated expert validation.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"outcome\">Outcome\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>The prototype demonstrated measurable improvement in student understanding of insomnia through user testing and expert evaluation.\u003C/p>",{"headings":33,"localImagePaths":44,"remoteImagePaths":45,"frontmatter":46,"imagePaths":49},[34,38,41],{"depth":35,"slug":36,"text":37},2,"overview","Overview",{"depth":35,"sl